    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. We also suspect the subgrade compaction might be a factor. Can you expand on how improper subgrade density or moisture content in the base layers can exacerbate those longitudinal cracks, especially when combined with the thermal expansion from the desert heat?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
